\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s4\", \"text\": \"Jorge Kalil, Director of Fundação Butantan.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"Her groundbreaking research and dedication to the scientific community have been invaluable to our institution and the field as a whole.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"A thorough examination of Villas Boas' publication record reveals a plethora of papers co-authored with researchers affiliated with Fundação Butantan, further solidifying her connection to the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"One such paper, published in the esteemed journal \\\"Vaccine,\\\" details a collaborative study on the development of novel vaccine candidates, with Villas Boas listed as a co-author alongside several Fundação Butantan researchers.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Data obtained from the Brazilian Ministry of Education also confirms Villas Boas' affiliation with Fundação Butantan, listing her as a researcher at the institution during a specific period.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"Isadora Maria Villas Boas is a highly respected figure in the scientific community, and her work has had a profound impact on our understanding of various diseases,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Maria Cristina P.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"S.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"S.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Guimarães, a colleague and fellow researcher.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"\\\"Her association with Fundação Butantan is a testament to the institution's commitment to excellence in research and its ability to attract top talent.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"In light of these findings, it is clear that Isadora Maria Villas Boas did, in fact, work for Fundação Butantan, contributing to the institution's rich legacy of scientific innovation and discovery.\"}]}"
